Meta.documentation:Number.modulo
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Remainder of division — the first Number modulo each of the rest.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The first Number in the flow is the dividend; every Number after it is used
Meta.documentation:as a modulus in turn. The result has the sign of the dividend
Meta.documentation:(−7 mod 3 is 2).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_dividend — the first Number
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — each modulus, applied in order
Meta.documentation:@port out_Number — the remainder, emitted at end of input
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Number:7 Number:3]>>Number.modulo:>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:1
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see Number.divide
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable
